cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pain001-mcp in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pain001-mcp: Model Context Protocol server for ISO 20022 payment files"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol server exposing the pain001 library to AI agents:
  twenty-one tools for generating and validating ISO 20022 pain.001 and
  pain.008 files, checking identifiers, parsing bank replies, converting MT101
  and reading the validated example corpus with its provenance.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
version: "0.0.70"
date-released: "2026-09-13"
license: "Apache-2.0 OR MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/pain001-mcp"
url: "https://pain001.com"
keywords:
  - ISO 20022
  - pain.001
  - Model Context Protocol
  - MCP
  - AI agents
  - payments
